LND="https://www.osha.gov/laundry"; CL="https://www.cdc.gov/infection-control/hcp/environmental-control/laundry-bedding.html"; LINT="https://www.usfa.fema.gov/prevention/home-fires/prevent-fires/clothes-dryers/"
LOTO="https://www.osha.gov/control-hazardous-energy"; CARE="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/clothes-captions-complying-care-labeling-rule"; PPE="https://www.osha.gov/personal-protective-equipment"
add(LA,"role",[
("dryer","easy","When should the dryer lint screen be cleaned?","¿Cuándo se limpia el filtro de pelusa de la secadora?",["Before or after every load","Once a week","Once a month","When it catches fire"],["Antes o después de cada carga","Una vez a la semana","Una vez al mes","Cuando se incendie"],"USFA: clean the lint filter every load — lint buildup is a leading cause of dryer fires.","USFA: limpia el filtro en cada carga; la pelusa causa muchos incendios.",LINT),
("dryer","med","Why shouldn't oily rags (from kitchen or maintenance) be dried and left piled warm?","¿Por qué no se deben dejar amontonados y calientes trapos con aceite?",["They can heat up and catch fire on their own","They shrink","They smell","They lose color"],["Se pueden calentar e incendiar solos","Se encogen","Huelen","Se destiñen"],"Oil-soaked fabric can self-heat after drying; cool-down cycles and spreading out prevent fires.","La tela con aceite puede calentarse sola; enfriar y extender evita incendios.",LINT),
("dryer","med","Why use the cool-down cycle at the end of drying?","¿Para qué sirve el ciclo de enfriamiento al final del secado?",["It lowers heat to prevent fires and wrinkles","It's just to save time","It adds softener","It sanitizes"],["Baja el calor para evitar incendios y arrugas","Solo ahorra tiempo","Agrega suavizante","Desinfecta"],"Hot piled linen holds heat; cool-down reduces fire risk.","La ropa caliente amontonada guarda calor; enfriar reduce el riesgo.",LINT),
("dryer","easy","What should you do if a dryer smells like burning?","¿Qué haces si una secadora huele a quemado?",["Stop it, keep the door closed if smoking, and tell your supervisor","Keep running it","Open it and grab the linen","Spray water inside"],["Apagarla, dejar la puerta cerrada si sale humo y avisar al supervisor","Dejarla funcionando","Abrirla y sacar la ropa","Echarle agua"],"Report immediately; don't open a smoldering dryer — it feeds the fire oxygen.","Reporta de inmediato; no abras una secadora con humo, le da oxígeno.",LINT),
("washer","easy","What's the danger of overloading a washer?","¿Qué pasa si sobrecargas la lavadora?",["Linen doesn't get clean or rinsed and the machine wears out","It cleans better","It saves water and works great","Nothing"],["La ropa no se lava ni enjuaga bien y la máquina se desgasta","Lava mejor","Ahorra agua y funciona perfecto","Nada"],"Follow the machine's rated load weight.","Respeta el peso de carga de la máquina.",BP),
("washer","med","Where do you find a washer's rated load capacity?","¿Dónde encuentras la capacidad de carga de la lavadora?",["On the machine's plate or manual (in pounds)","On the linen tag","On the detergent box","Guess by eye"],["En la placa o manual de la máquina (en libras)","En la etiqueta de la ropa","En la caja de detergente","Al tanteo"],"Commercial washers are rated by dry weight.","Las lavadoras comerciales se miden por peso seco.",BP),
("washer","hard","Why weigh or count a load instead of 'stuffing it full'?","¿Por qué pesar o contar la carga en lugar de 'llenarla'?",["Consistent loads get the right chemical dose and clean evenly","It's slower","It uses more water","No reason"],["Cargas parejas reciben la dosis correcta y se lavan igual","Es más lento","Gasta más agua","Por nada"],"Dosing systems assume a set load weight.","Los dosificadores asumen un peso fijo.",BP),
("lockout","med","A washer jams mid-cycle. Can you reach in while it's powered?","Una lavadora se atora a medio ciclo. ¿Puedes meter la mano estando prendida?",["No — stop it, wait, and call maintenance; follow lockout rules","Yes, quickly","Yes, with gloves","Only if it's slow"],["No; apágala, espera y llama a mantenimiento; sigue el bloqueo","Sí, rápido","Sí, con guantes","Solo si va lento"],"OSHA lockout/tagout protects workers from machines starting.","El bloqueo/etiquetado de OSHA protege de arranques.",LOTO),
("lockout","easy","A machine has a 'Do Not Operate' tag on it. What do you do?","Una máquina tiene etiqueta 'No operar'. ¿Qué haces?",["Leave it off — only the person who tagged it removes the tag","Remove the tag and use it","Use it carefully","Throw the tag away"],["No usarla; solo quien la etiquetó quita la etiqueta","Quitar la etiqueta y usarla","Usarla con cuidado","Tirar la etiqueta"],"OSHA: tags are removed only by the authorized person.","OSHA: solo la persona autorizada quita la etiqueta.",LOTO),
("chemicals","med","The auto-dispense detergent pump is leaking. What's safest?","La bomba de detergente automático gotea. ¿Qué es lo más seguro?",["Wear gloves/goggles per the SDS, contain it, and report it","Wipe with bare hands","Ignore it","Mix in bleach to clean it"],["Usar guantes y lentes según la SDS, contener y reportar","Limpiar con la mano","Ignorarlo","Mezclar con cloro"],"Laundry chemicals can be caustic; follow SDS PPE.","Los químicos de lavandería pueden ser corrosivos; usa el EPP de la SDS.",HAZ),
("chemicals","easy","Laundry chemical splashes in your eye. First thing?","Te salpica químico de lavandería en el ojo. ¿Primero qué?",["Flush with water at the eyewash for at least 15 minutes","Rub it","Wait","Use a towel only"],["Enjuagar en el lavaojos al menos 15 minutos","Tallarlo","Esperar","Solo una toalla"],"OSHA/SDS first aid: flush eyes 15+ minutes.","Primeros auxilios: enjuaga 15 minutos o más.",FA),
("chemicals","med","Why is bleach not used on every load?","¿Por qué no se usa cloro en todas las cargas?",["It can weaken fibers and damage colors — use it only where the program calls for it","It's illegal","It makes linen dirtier","It's too cheap"],["Debilita fibras y daña colores; solo donde el programa lo indique","Es ilegal","Ensucia más","Es muy barato"],"Follow the chemical program and fabric care labels.","Sigue el programa de químicos y las etiquetas.",CARE),
("ppe","easy","What PPE do you wear when sorting soiled linen?","¿Qué EPP usas al separar ropa sucia?",["Gloves (and more if there's blood or fluids)","None","Only an apron","Sunglasses"],["Guantes (y más si hay sangre o fluidos)","Nada","Solo mandil","Lentes de sol"],"OSHA bloodborne pathogens: gloves for contaminated laundry.","OSHA: guantes para ropa contaminada.",BBP),
("soiled","med","How should linen with blood on it be handled?","¿Cómo se maneja la ropa con sangre?",["Bag it separately with minimal handling, wearing gloves","Shake it out first","Rinse it in a sink with bare hands","Mix it with clean linen"],["Embolsarla aparte con mínimo manejo y con guantes","Sacudirla primero","Enjuagarla a mano sin guantes","Mezclarla con ropa limpia"],"OSHA: handle contaminated laundry as little as possible; don't sort or rinse where used.","OSHA: manipula lo menos posible; no separes ni enjuagues en el lugar.",BBP),
("soiled","easy","Why not shake dirty linen?","¿Por qué no se sacude la ropa sucia?",["It spreads germs and dust into the air","It wrinkles","It's slow","It tears"],["Esparce gérmenes y polvo al aire","Se arruga","Es lento","Se rompe"],"CDC: avoid shaking soiled linen.","CDC: evita sacudir la ropa sucia.",CL),
("sorting","easy","Before washing, what should you check pockets and linen for?","Antes de lavar, ¿qué buscas en la ropa?",["Sharp objects, pens, and guest items","Nothing","Only stains","Only colors"],["Objetos filosos, plumas y cosas del huésped","Nada","Solo manchas","Solo colores"],"Needles, pens and phones can hurt you or ruin a whole load.","Agujas, plumas y celulares lastiman o arruinan la carga.",BP),
("sorting","med","You find a guest's ring in the sheets. What do you do?","Encuentras un anillo de un huésped en las sábanas. ¿Qué haces?",["Give it to your supervisor for lost and found with the room/date if known","Keep it","Leave it in the linen","Sell it"],["Darlo al supervisor para objetos perdidos con cuarto y fecha si se sabe","Quedártelo","Dejarlo en la ropa","Venderlo"],"Lost items are logged so the guest can be contacted.","Se registran para contactar al huésped.",BP),
("stains","med","A white towel has makeup stains. What's best?","Una toalla blanca tiene manchas de maquillaje. ¿Qué es lo mejor?",["Pre-treat/send to the reclaim (stain) process before the regular wash","Wash it normally and hope","Throw it out right away","Dry it on high"],["Pretratar o mandar a recuperación de manchas antes del lavado normal","Lavarla normal","Tirarla","Secarla en alto"],"Heat sets stains; treat before drying.","El calor fija las manchas; trata antes de secar.",BP),
("stains","easy","Why not dry a stained item before it's treated?","¿Por qué no secar algo manchado antes de tratarlo?",["Dryer heat can set the stain permanently","It dries faster","It's the rule for colors only","No reason"],["El calor de la secadora puede fijar la mancha","Se seca más rápido","Solo para colores","Por nada"],"Heat sets most protein and oil stains.","El calor fija manchas de proteína y grasa.",BP),
("rags","easy","A torn or permanently stained towel should be…","Una toalla rota o con mancha permanente se debe…",["Pulled from service (rag-out) and recorded","Folded and sent to a room","Hidden","Put back in the wash forever"],["Retirar (a trapos) y registrar","Doblar y mandar al cuarto","Esconder","Lavar para siempre"],"Guests should never get damaged linen; tracking helps ordering.","El huésped nunca debe recibir ropa dañada; registrar ayuda a pedir.",BP),
("folding","easy","Why fold linen right after the dryer?","¿Por qué doblar la ropa justo al salir de la secadora?",["Fewer wrinkles and a better look","It's warmer for you","It's faster to leave it","Doesn't matter"],["Menos arrugas y mejor presentación","Está calientita","Dejarla es más rápido","No importa"],"Linen left in a pile wrinkles and holds heat.","La ropa amontonada se arruga y guarda calor.",BP),
("folding","med","What should a folded towel stack look like for a cart?","¿Cómo debe verse una pila de toallas para el carro?",["Same fold, edges facing the same way, neat stacks","Any fold","Rolled tight","Mixed sizes"],["Mismo doblez, orillas al mismo lado, pilas parejas","Cualquier doblez","Enrollada","Tamaños mezclados"],"Consistent folds speed up room setup and look professional.","Un doblez uniforme ahorra tiempo y se ve profesional.",BP),
("par","med","What does linen 'par' mean?","¿Qué significa 'par' de blancos?",["The number of complete sets per bed needed to run the hotel","A golf term only","Linen thrown out","A price"],["Cuántos juegos completos por cama se necesitan para operar","Solo término de golf","Ropa tirada","Un precio"],"Hotels often run about 3–4 par: one on the bed, one in laundry, one on the shelf, spare.","Se manejan 3–4 juegos: en la cama, en lavandería, en el estante y repuesto.",BP),
("par","hard","Why does running low on linen par hurt the hotel?","¿Por qué afecta quedarse bajo de juegos de blancos?",["Linen gets rushed and worn faster and rooms can't be finished","It saves money","Nothing happens","It makes linen softer"],["Se apresura y desgasta más la ropa y no se terminan cuartos","Ahorra dinero","No pasa nada","La suaviza"],"Linen needs rest time between uses; low par causes delays.","La ropa necesita descanso entre usos; poco par causa retrasos.",BP),
("carts","easy","Clean and dirty linen carts should be…","Los carros de ropa limpia y sucia deben…",["Kept separate and clearly marked","Shared","Mixed to save space","Left in the hallway"],["Estar separados y marcados","Compartirse","Mezclarse","Quedar en el pasillo"],"CDC: separate clean and soiled linen to prevent contamination.","CDC: separar limpia y sucia para evitar contaminación.",CL),
("carts","med","Clean linen is being moved through the building. How should it be covered?","Se mueve ropa limpia por el hotel. ¿Cómo se cubre?",["Covered or in a closed cart","It doesn't need covering","Wrapped in dirty sheets","On the floor"],["Tapada o en carro cerrado","No hace falta","Envuelta en sábanas sucias","En el piso"],"CDC: protect clean linen from contamination in transport.","CDC: protege la ropa limpia al transportarla.",CL),
("floor","easy","Clean linen falls on the floor. What do you do?","Se cae ropa limpia al piso. ¿Qué haces?",["Rewash it","Fold it anyway","Shake it off","Use it for the GM only"],["Volver a lavarla","Doblarla igual","Sacudirla","Solo para el gerente"],"Floor contact contaminates clean linen.","El piso contamina la ropa limpia.",CL),
("heat","med","The laundry room is very hot in summer. What helps?","La lavandería está muy caliente en verano. ¿Qué ayuda?",["Drink water often, take breaks, and tell your supervisor if you feel sick","Work through it","Drink only soda","Wear more layers"],["Tomar agua seguido, descansar y avisar si te sientes mal","Aguantarte","Solo refresco","Más ropa"],"OSHA heat guidance: water, rest, shade.","OSHA: agua, descanso, sombra.",HEAT),
("ergonomics","med","How can you reduce strain pulling wet linen from a washer?","¿Cómo reduces el esfuerzo al sacar ropa mojada de la lavadora?",["Pull smaller amounts, keep it close, and avoid twisting","Pull it all at once","Twist and throw","Use one arm"],["Sacar menos a la vez, pegada al cuerpo, sin girar","Toda de un jalón","Girar y aventar","Un solo brazo"],"OSHA ergonomics for laundry.","Ergonomía OSHA en lavandería.",LIFT),
("ergonomics","easy","Wet linen is how much heavier than dry?","¿Cuánto más pesa la ropa mojada que seca?",["Much heavier — often 2 or more times","The same","Lighter","Slightly lighter"],["Mucho más; a veces el doble o más","Igual","Más ligera","Un poco más ligera"],"Water weight adds up fast; lift smart.","El agua pesa; levanta con cuidado.",LIFT),
("floor","easy","Water on the laundry floor near machines. What first?","Hay agua en el piso junto a las máquinas. ¿Primero qué?",["Wet-floor sign, then mop and report any leak","Ignore","Walk fast","Cover with towels and leave"],["Señal de piso mojado, trapear y reportar la fuga","Ignorar","Caminar rápido","Tapar con toallas e irte"],"OSHA walking-working surfaces.","OSHA superficies.",SLIP),
("pillows","med","How should pillows and comforters be washed?","¿Cómo se lavan almohadas y edredones?",["Per the care label, on the right cycle, and fully dried to avoid mildew","Hot and high with bleach always","Never","By hand only"],["Según la etiqueta, en el ciclo correcto y bien secos para evitar moho","Siempre caliente y con cloro","Nunca","Solo a mano"],"FTC care labels give the right method.","Las etiquetas de cuidado indican el método.",CARE),
("care_label","easy","What does a tub symbol with one dot mean on a care label?","¿Qué significa una tina con un punto en la etiqueta?",["Wash cold","Wash hot","Dry clean only","Do not wash"],["Lavar en frío","Lavar caliente","Solo en seco","No lavar"],"Care symbols: more dots = hotter water; one dot is cold.","Más puntos = más caliente; un punto es frío.",CARE),
("care_label","med","A triangle with an X on a care label means…","Un triángulo con X en la etiqueta significa…",["Do not bleach","Bleach only","Dry clean","Iron"],["No usar cloro","Solo cloro","Lavado en seco","Planchar"],"Triangle = bleach; crossed out = no bleach.","Triángulo = cloro; tachado = no cloro.",CARE),
("mildew","easy","Damp linen left in a cart overnight can…","Ropa húmeda en un carro toda la noche puede…",["Grow mildew and smell","Get cleaner","Get softer","Nothing"],["Hacer moho y oler","Quedar más limpia","Más suave","Nada"],"Wet linen should go to dry promptly.","La ropa mojada debe secarse pronto.",BP),
("energy","med","Why not run a dryer half empty?","¿Por qué no usar la secadora medio vacía?",["It wastes energy and gas","It dries better","It's required","It protects the drum"],["Gasta energía y gas","Seca mejor","Es obligatorio","Protege el tambor"],"Full (not over-full) loads use energy best.","Cargas completas (no de más) aprovechan energía.",BP),
("guest_items","med","A guest's own clothes come down to laundry with hotel linen. What do you do?","Ropa del huésped baja a lavandería con la del hotel. ¿Qué haces?",["Keep it separate and give it to your supervisor","Wash it with hotel linen","Throw it away","Keep it"],["Apartarla y dársela al supervisor","Lavarla con la del hotel","Tirarla","Quedártela"],"Guest property is lost and found.","Lo del huésped va a objetos perdidos.",BP),
("lint","hard","Besides the lint screen, what other dryer area builds up lint and needs regular service?","Aparte del filtro, ¿qué parte de la secadora junta pelusa y necesita servicio?",["The exhaust duct/vent","The door glass","The control panel","The drum paint"],["El ducto de escape","El vidrio de la puerta","El tablero","La pintura del tambor"],"USFA: clean the vent and exhaust duct regularly.","USFA: limpia el ducto con regularidad.",LINT),
("schedule","easy","Why wash in the order your supervisor sets (e.g., sheets first)?","¿Por qué lavar en el orden del supervisor (por ejemplo sábanas primero)?",["Rooms need specific items first so housekeeping isn't waiting","It's random","Machines need it","For fun"],["Los cuartos necesitan ciertas piezas primero para no esperar","Es al azar","Las máquinas lo piden","Por gusto"],"Priorities keep room attendants supplied.","Las prioridades abastecen a las recamareras.",BP),
("tools","med","Why keep the laundry door closed and the room organized?","¿Por qué mantener la puerta cerrada y la lavandería ordenada?",["Security, fire safety and fewer trips and slips","It looks nicer only","To hide work","No reason"],["Seguridad, prevención de incendios y menos tropiezos","Solo se ve mejor","Para esconder el trabajo","Por nada"],"Clutter and lint are fire and trip hazards.","El desorden y la pelusa son riesgo de incendio y tropiezos.",SLIP),
("towels","med","New towels sometimes leave lint. Why wash new linen before use?","Las toallas nuevas sueltan pelusa. ¿Por qué lavarlas antes de usarlas?",["To remove finishes and lint so they absorb well","They're dirty from guests","It's not needed","To shrink them"],["Para quitar acabados y pelusa y que absorban","Están sucias de huéspedes","No hace falta","Para encogerlas"],"New linen has sizing that reduces absorbency.","La ropa nueva trae apresto que reduce la absorción.",BP),
])
